# The figure atlas is PUBLISHED as code (2026-08-17): ecomics/plots.py holds the
# house style, ecomics/figures/ the builders, scripts/15_figures.py the driver.
# The three travel together -- 15_figures.py is the package's only consumer, and
# publishing the script without the package would ship an ImportError on
# `from ecomics import figures`.
#
# Its OUTPUT is not published: `results/figures/` and `results/*.png` above stay
# ignored, so a reader renders their own from the committed results/*.json rather
# than reading a PNG that a later run has silently outdated. `15_figures.py`
# computes nothing, so the renders are always regenerable.
#
# THIS FILE IS THIS REPOSITORY'S SCOPE STATEMENT. Adding or removing a line here
# publishes or unpublishes code; it is not housekeeping.
